\label{lem:delta-inv}
$\delta$ is invariant under the NS symmetry group:
\begin{enumerate}[label=(\alph*)]
\item Scaling: $\delta(\lambda u(\lambda\cdot)) = \delta(u)$;
\item Translation: $\delta(u(\cdot - x_0)) = \delta(u)$;
\item Rotation: $\delta(Ru(R^{-1}\cdot)) = \delta(u)$.
\end{enumerate}

