hierarchy monotonicity (Gap~2, Section~\ref{sec:gaps}):
\begin{equation}
H(q,p)(t) \leq C_H\,\cS(t) \quad\text{for all }t\geq 0,
\end{equation}
where $C_H = \max\!\bigl(R_0,\;1 + C\pi/2\bigr)$ with $R_0 = \max_j r_j(0)$.
No spread condition, sub-criticality condition, or profile decomposition
is required.

