= \frac{2}{E}\sum_j p_j\Bigl(\sum_{\hat k\in\Omega_j}T(k;u)
- p_j\sum_k T(k;u)\Bigr).
\end{equation}
Spreading corresponds to $\Sigma < 0$ (concentration
decreasing); concentration to $\Sigma > 0$.

\label{thm:antisym}
