Actually, the conservation is $\sum_\ell T_{jk}^\ell = 0$ where $T_{jk}^\ell$ includes ALL caps $\ell$ (including $j$ and $k$). The interaction $(u_j \cdot \nabla u_k)$ CAN transfer energy to/from $j$ and $k$.

