\end{equation}

For $q, k$ within a cone of opening angle $\theta_0$, we have $\alpha \leq \theta_0$, so:
\begin{itemize}
\item Same helicity ($\tau = \rho$): $|\langle h^\tau, h^\rho \rangle| \geq \cos^2(\theta_0/2) \geq 1 - \theta_0^2/4$
