\leq C_\cS\,\frac{\norm{u_0}_{L^2}^4}{\nu^2},
\end{equation}
where $C_\cS$ depends on the initial $\Hdot{1/2}$ energy
and the number of sectors~$J$.

\label{thm:spread-intro}
