\frac{\kappa_j^2}{\kappa^2},
\end{equation}
where $\kappa_j^2 = D_j/E_j$ (sector mean-squared
wavenumber) and $\kappa^2 = D/E$ (global mean).

following_proof:
With $r_j = \kappa_j^2/\kappa^2$ and $f_j = \log(1/p_j)$:
