H(q,p) = \sum_j q_j f_j
= \frac{\sum_j p_j r_j f_j}{\sum_j p_j r_j}
\leq \frac{(\max_j r_j)\sum_j p_j f_j}{\sum_j p_j r_j}
= (\max_j r_j)\cdot\cS,
