\leq c_1\,\delta(u)\,\frac{D}{E},
\end{equation}
where $\delta$ is the angular concentration,
$D = \norm{u}_{\Hdot{3/2}}^2$, and
$E = \norm{u}_{\Hdot{1/2}}^2$.

