\label{thm:same-far}
For same-scale triads ($|p|/|q|\in[\eta,1/\eta]$) with
angular separation $\angle(\hat{p},\hat{q}) > \beta$
(where $\beta \geq \alpha = \diam(\Omega_j)$):
\begin{equation}
