=
\frac12\int_0^t \varphi''(Y_s)\,d\langle Y\rangle_s^{\mathrm{intr}},
\end{equation}
where $\langle Y\rangle^{\mathrm{intr}}$ is the bracket canonically induced by the derivative--projection architecture rather than assumed pathwise in advance.

