\label{def:op_exp}
Let $M$ be an additive process in the operator framework for which the intrinsic bracket
\[
\langle M\rangle_t^{(D,\Pi)} := \int_0^t \|\Pi DM_s\|_{\mathcal H}^2\,ds
\]
