\label{def:intrinsic-bracket}
Let $Y = (Y_t)_{t \in [0,T]}$ be such that $Y_t \in \Dom(D)$ for a.e.\ $t$ and $t \mapsto \Pi DY_t$ lies in $\Lp{2}([0,T] \times \Omega; \HH)$. Define the \emph{intrinsic bracket}
