\]

\item The drift satisfies $\int_0^T |a_s|^p\, ds < \infty$ almost surely for some $p > \frac{2}{2H}$.

\item For $F \in C_b^1(\R)$, the product $F(Y_s) \Pi DY_s$ lies in $L^2([0,T] \times \Omega; H) \cap \Dom(\delta)$.
