&\quad + \frac{1}{2} \sum_{i,j=1}^n \int_0^t \partial_i \partial_j \varphi(Y_s) \ip{\Pi DY_s^i}{\Pi DY_s^j}_H\, ds. \label{eq:ito-multi}
