\]
cannot be expressed as a finite sum of terms involving $D_X F$, $D_X G$, and their products.

\label{prop:Itop}
For $f \in C^p_b(\R)$,
\begin{equation}
\label{eq:Itop}
f(X_T) - f(0) = \int_0^T f'(X_s)\, dX_s + c_p \int_0^T f^{(p)}(X_s)\, ds.
\end{equation}
The time-dependent version: for $f \in C^{1,p}_b([0,T] \times \R)$,
\begin{equation}
\label{eq:Itop-time}
