\begin{enumerate}
\item The coefficient $Ht^{2H-1}$ equals $\frac{1}{2}\frac{d}{dt}\|k^H_t\|^2_{\Hi_H}$.
\item This generalizes: for \emph{any} Gaussian process, the analogous coefficient is $\frac{1}{2}\frac{d}{dt}R(t,t)$.
