On the physical (transverse) subspace at momentum $k \neq 0$:
\begin{equation}\label{eq:christoffel-ratio}
  \frac{\|P_\perp\,\hat{S}^{\mathrm{anti}}(k)\,P_\perp\|}{\khat^2}
  \leq \frac{1}{32}
