By reflection positivity~\cite{FroehlichSimon,OS78} and the infrared
bound, the mass gap at the matching scale satisfies
\begin{equation}\label{eq:mgap}
m\ge-\frac{1}{\ell_*}\log\bigl\langle\tfrac{1}{2}\tr\,U_p
\bigr\rangle_{\beta_*}
=\frac{0.0067}{\ell_*},
\end{equation}
where $\langle\frac{1}{2}\tr\,U_p\rangle_{150}=I_{3/2}(150)/I_{1/2}(150)
=0.9933$ is the mean plaquette computed from modified Bessel functions.

In the continuum limit:
\begin{equation}\label{eq:mgap-phys}
m_{\mathrm{phys}}=\frac{0.0067}{\ell_*}
=0.0067\cdot\Lam\cdot e^{404}\ge c\cdot\Lam>0.
\end{equation}

