$\lambda_{\min}(H_{\mathrm{eff}}^{\mathrm{ab}})=0.6964$);
\item $\kappa_{k+1}\ge\kappa_0>0$ (decay rate bounded below);
\item gauge invariance preserved (Proposition~\ref{prop:equiv}).
\end{enumerate}
The iteration terminates at the matching scale
$\beta_{k_*}=\beta_*$.

