scale~$\mu$: $g(\mu)^2 = 1/(2\beta_0 \log(\mu
/\Lambda_{\mathrm{QCD}}))$.  For
$\mu = R\,\Lambda_{\mathrm{QCD}}$ with $R$ large:
\begin{equation}
  e^{-c/g(\mu)^2}
  = e^{-2c\beta_0\,\log R}
  = R^{-2c\beta_0}.
\end{equation}
