  \,S_W(x) - R_{k_*}(x)\bigr)\,\prod_\ell dU_\ell
\end{equation}
with $\sum_{X \ni \ell} \sup |a_{k_*}(X)|
\leq \varepsilon < \varepsilon_0(d)$ where
\begin{equation}\label{eq:eps0}
