  \,S_W(x) - R_k(x)\bigr)\,\prod_\ell dU_\ell,
\end{equation}
where $\beta_{\mathrm{eff}}(k) = \beta / L^{kd}$ and
the remainder~$R_k$ satisfies:
\begin{enumerate}[label=\textup{(B\arabic*)},nosep]
