The relative entropy $W_k = \KL(\mu_k \| \nu_k)$ satisfies
\begin{equation}\label{eq:entropy_decay}
  W_k \;\leq\; (1 - f)^k \cdot \frac{C}{\beta^2},
\end{equation}
with $f \geq 0.527$ and $C$ depending only on $d$, $N$, $L$.
