  = \frac{1}{a}\,e^{-1/(2\beta_0 g^2(a))}
  \,(2\beta_0 g^2(a))^{-\beta_1/(2\beta_0^2)}\,
  [1 + O(g^2)],
\end{equation}
which converges as $a \to 0$ (since $\delta g \to 0$).
The theory is uniquely determined by~$G$
and~$\Lambda_{\mathrm{QCD}}$.

