\label{thm:scaling}
Let $K = K_H$ (fractional kernel), $\nu$ satisfying
\Cref{ass:nu} with local stable index $\gamma \in (1,2)$,
and $f \in C_b^3(\R)$.  Fix $p \in (1,\gamma)$ satisfying
