\label{prop:MRT}
Under \Cref{ass:market}, every $F \in L^2(\F_T, \QQ)$ admits
the unique martingale representation
\begin{equation}\label{eq:MRT}
  F = \E^\QQ[F]
  + \int_0^T \phi_t^\perp\,dW_t^{\perp,\QQ}
  + \int_0^T \phi_t^W\,dW_t^\QQ
  + \int_0^T\!\!\int_\R
