with $\xi_t^W \neq 0$ a.s.\ whenever $\eta\sigma_L > 0$
(i.e., whenever the model has stochastic volatility with a
continuous component).

\label{lem:agg-kernel}
For $K_H(s,t) = (s-t)^{H-1/2}$:
\begin{equation}\label{eq:agg-norm}
