$\int |z|^2\,\nu(dz) < \infty$.

\label{def:VL}
Let $K : [0,T]^2 \to \R$ be a causal kernel ($K(t,s) = 0$ for
$s > t$). The \emph{Volterra--L\'evy process} is
\begin{equation}\label{eq:VL}
