\item the flow in the gauge-invariant sector has a one-dimensional unstable/marginal manifold corresponding to the gauge kinetic term (the YM direction),
\item the renormalized coupling $g_R(\mu)$ extracted from a standard gauge-invariant scheme satisfies the universal one-loop asymptotic freedom law (for $\SU(2)$):
