=DF|_0^T\cdot D^2 S|_{y_*}\cdot DF|_0
\;+\;\underbrace{\sum_m\frac{\partial S}{\partial U_m}\bigg|_{y_*}
\cdot D^2 F_m|_0}_{=\,0\;\text{(criticality)}}.
\end{equation}
